{"deps":{"Lfan-ke/moonapi":"0.1.0","Lfan-ke/moonrpc":"0.4.0","Lfan-ke/moonasgi":"0.1.0"},"name":"Lfan-ke/moonzero","readme":"README.md","yanked":true,"license":"Apache-2.0","version":"0.5.0","checksum":"c8d75a64396708553eccdb2745a5269ce85dc600e8442504bbca53395a23be2f","keywords":["go-zero","microservice","server","middleware","moonapi","moonbit"],"created_at":"2026-07-28T17:12:18.234704+00:00","repository":"https://github.com/Lfan-ke/moonzero","description":"moonzero — a service framework for MoonBit (← go-zero): config-driven assembly of a moonapi application with middleware, producing a runnable moonasgi AsgiApp. v0.5 runs a real unary zRPC call over moonrpc's h2c transport (an in-process RpcChannel drives HPACK HEADERS + length-prefixed DATA + grpc-status trailers through the H2Server engine), and adds an etcd-shaped service registry with round-robin/pick-first balancers, request metrics (counter + latency histogram), and W3C traceparent propagation.","yanked_reason":"Moved to moonbitstack/moonzero."}
